<title>JAPAN: Suzuki Shutter -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Suzuki Shutter -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.07		vs	    6.10</p>
<p> Operating    loss 78    million	  vs   loss 164    million</p>
<p> Current     loss 103    million	  vs   loss 208    million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 147    million	  vs   loss 235    million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 15.49 yen	  vs    loss 24.74 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - Suzuki Shutter Manufacturing Co Ltd is a manufacturer of shutters.</p>
